    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO MIXCITY SWAP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras/c76d9db3f4c0f71c50e248e1111dbcde.avif?t=1749828376\" data-has-big width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight other players in <strong>MIXCITY SWAP</strong>, a fast-paced online <strong>free-to-play</strong> card game that\u2019s easy to learn but full of strategy. Here, all sports mix together \u2014 <strong>from football to p\u00e9tanque, e-sports, even chess</strong>. Because sports and games are meant to bring people together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal? To make a game that\u2019s <strong>competitive, fun, and easy to play</strong>, just like our studio's style: <strong>smart, strategic, and always full of surprises</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras/82fa0c57e1d3a2ac2d9c23de6e64c6e6.avif?t=1749828376\" data-has-big width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first player to get <strong>5 KOs</strong> wins the match \u2014 so be smart!<br>Games last <strong>less than 10 minutes</strong>, perfect to play fast, chain matches, and test your decks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras/7242c703f1f6a54810944f9af772b1fe.avif?t=1749828376\" data-has-big width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>MIXCITY SWAP</strong>, there\u2019s <strong>no drawing cards</strong> \u2014 you can play any card from the start.<br>That means <strong>no luck</strong>, just smart plays and real skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like aggressive moves? Or control? Or maybe playing slow and safe?<br><strong>Build the deck</strong> that matches your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras/9cf708f90433edc761ead5949bd37c5b.avif?t=1749828376\" data-has-big width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main mechanic is called <strong>\u201cSWAP\u201d</strong> \u2014 it lets you <strong>switch a card from your hand with one already on the field</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use it to <strong>save a card</strong> that\u2019s about to get KO\u2019d.<br>But it can also <strong>trigger effects</strong> like <strong>buffs</strong>, damage, healing, or even an instant KO\u2026<br>It all depends on your cards and your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need to <strong>think about your placements, protect key cards, predict your opponent\u2019s plays, and create big combos</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move matters. Every SWAP can change the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras/df954794db273caa50e64183d651c91e.avif?t=1749828376\" data-has-big width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MIXCITY</strong> is a <strong>futuristic city</strong> where all sports are celebrated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A table tennis player can fight a boxer. A rugby player teams up with a high-tech para-athlete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But most of all, it\u2019s <strong>an inclusive city</strong> \u2014 fun, kind, and full of life, where people and sports are the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want to join the Playtest sessions? Click the \u201cRequest Access\u201d button!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you want to follow the game\u2019s development, <strong>join us on Discord!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO MIXCITY SWAP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras/c76d9db3f4c0f71c50e248e1111dbcde.avif?t=1749828376\" data-has-big width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight other players in <strong>MIXCITY SWAP</strong>, a fast-paced online <strong>free-to-play</strong> card game that\u2019s easy to learn but full of strategy. Here, all sports mix together \u2014 <strong>from football to p\u00e9tanque, e-sports, even chess</strong>. Because sports and games are meant to bring people together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal? To make a game that\u2019s <strong>competitive, fun, and easy to play</strong>, just like our studio's style: <strong>smart, strategic, and always full of surprises</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras/82fa0c57e1d3a2ac2d9c23de6e64c6e6.avif?t=1749828376\" data-has-big width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first player to get <strong>5 KOs</strong> wins the match \u2014 so be smart!<br>Games last <strong>less than 10 minutes</strong>, perfect to play fast, chain matches, and test your decks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras/7242c703f1f6a54810944f9af772b1fe.avif?t=1749828376\" data-has-big width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>MIXCITY SWAP</strong>, there\u2019s <strong>no drawing cards</strong> \u2014 you can play any card from the start.<br>That means <strong>no luck</strong>, just smart plays and real skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like aggressive moves? Or control? Or maybe playing slow and safe?<br><strong>Build the deck</strong> that matches your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras/9cf708f90433edc761ead5949bd37c5b.avif?t=1749828376\" data-has-big width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main mechanic is called <strong>\u201cSWAP\u201d</strong> \u2014 it lets you <strong>switch a card from your hand with one already on the field</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use it to <strong>save a card</strong> that\u2019s about to get KO\u2019d.<br>But it can also <strong>trigger effects</strong> like <strong>buffs</strong>, damage, healing, or even an instant KO\u2026<br>It all depends on your cards and your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need to <strong>think about your placements, protect key cards, predict your opponent\u2019s plays, and create big combos</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move matters. Every SWAP can change the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras/df954794db273caa50e64183d651c91e.avif?t=1749828376\" data-has-big width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MIXCITY</strong> is a <strong>futuristic city</strong> where all sports are celebrated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A table tennis player can fight a boxer. A rugby player teams up with a high-tech para-athlete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But most of all, it\u2019s <strong>an inclusive city</strong> \u2014 fun, kind, and full of life, where people and sports are the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want to join the Playtest sessions? Click the \u201cRequest Access\u201d button!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you want to follow the game\u2019s development, <strong>join us on Discord!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "MIXCITY SWAP is a fresh and dynamic card game set in a futuristic world where athletes from all sports compete for the crowd\u2019s excitement. Build your team by selecting 9 unique athletes and be the first to score 5 KOs to win the match!",
